      "content": "hey, i'm prepping for a meeting with some local officials next week. my manufacturing plant is getting hit hard by these new carbon emission standards and the compliance costs are gonna be huge. can you give me a solid list of arguments i can use against these new regulations to show how much they're gonna hurt local businesses? thanks.",
